{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12105330","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12105330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1210533001:1":{"text":"천천히 가. 너희는 이 앞에 있는 문을 통과할 수 없을 테니까.","source_cn":"跑慢点，前面的门你们过不去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D603A5350559339","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1210533002:1":{"text":"어떻게 알지?","source_cn":"你怎么知道？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x399C303FFEFEBDE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210533003:1":{"text":"봐, 이 문은 한방향으로만 열리는 문이야.","source_cn":"瞧，这道门是单向门，只能从一边打开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07FD757735139FA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210533004:1":{"text":"열 수 있어?","source_cn":"你会开？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D823720EA012A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210533005:1":{"text":"물론이지.","source_cn":"当然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD3748C00199F0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210533006:1":{"text":"그럼 열어.","source_cn":"那就开门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE1E444904EB8C8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210533007:0":{"text":"먼저 내 밧줄부터 풀어줘.","source_cn":"你们得先把我的绳子解开。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D60535BF3E5D4B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210533008:1":{"text":"잠깐, 또 우리를 속이고 도망가려는 건 아니겠죠...","source_cn":"等等，你不会又在骗我们，想趁机逃走吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B4A2521AE348E7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210533009:1":{"text":"여기 사람이 이렇게나 많은데다 대마법사 멀린까지 있는데 설마 나 하나 제압 못 할까 봐 걱정하는 거야?","source_cn":"你们这么多人，还有大魔法师梅林在，难道还怕我一个？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB68950FF5E1D5675","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"여기 사람이 이렇게나 많은데다 대마법사 멀린까지 있는데 설마 나 하나 제압 못 할까 봐 걱정하는 거야?","female":"여기 사람이 이렇게나 많은데다 대마법사 멀린까지 있는데 설마 나 하나 제압 못 할까 봐 걱정하는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"130032","variant_female_record_index":"130033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210533010:1":{"text":"이 문을 열 수 있는 건 블러디 로즈의 배신자 아니면 물귀신뿐이야.","source_cn":"会开这道门的，除了血薇帮的叛徒，就是水鬼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFAA3FADD420CCB7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1210533011:1":{"text":"넌 대체 어느 쪽이지?","source_cn":"你又是哪边的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x073E082DB96D717C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210533012:1":{"text":"이봐, 이봐! 할 말 있으면 좋게 얘기해. 검으로 사람 겁주지 말고.","source_cn":"哎，哎！朋友，有话好好说，别拿剑吓唬人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC032B80C07EA2DDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210533013:0":{"text":"나처럼 부두에서 겨우 밥이나 벌어 먹고사는 사람한테 고용주가 하나일 리가 없잖아~ 물귀신의 일이라고 내가 거절할 거라 생각해?","source_cn":"我这种在码头勉强讨生活的穷人，不可能只有一个雇主。再说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC327F442464223E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210533014:1":{"text":"문 열어. 테시오를 붙잡아 준다면 널 물고기 먹이로 던지진 않을 테니.","source_cn":"开门，帮我们抓到泰西欧，我可以不把你扔到海里喂鱼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E78BAC53D18A795","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210533015:1":{"text":"난 그저 밧줄을 풀고 몸을 좀 자유롭게 움직이고 싶을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"我只想拜托你解开绳子，放我自由。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB029D02EB2E1B4B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210533016:1":{"text":"...멀린, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"……梅林，你怎么看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04AAA21E1E034522","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...멀린, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","female":"...멀린, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","variant_male_record_index":"130040","variant_female_record_index":"130041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:19:1210533016":{"text":"...멀린, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","source_cn":"……梅林，你怎么看？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04AAA21E1E034522","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...멀린, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","female":"...멀린, 넌 어떻게 생각해?","variant_male_record_index":"130040","variant_female_record_index":"130041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210533019:0":{"text":"휴... 고마워. 바로 문 열게...","source_cn":"呼……感谢。我这就帮你们开门……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06E0312D3C5715F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:23:1210532001:":{"text":"그럼 난 먼저 간다!","source_cn":"我先走一步啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BB5A04945CCBB76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1210534001:0":{"text":"역시... 신밧드... 도망갔어요. 믿어서는 안 되는 거였는데!","source_cn":"辛巴达果然跑了，就知道不能相信他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F01C374A37ADE2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1210534002:0":{"text":"쫓을 필요 없어. 신밧드는 도망친 게 아니라 테시오를 쫓으러 간 거야.","source_cn":"不用追，他不是逃跑，而是去追泰西欧了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B6E31FD6F4FCEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1210534003:0":{"text":"왜 테시오를 쫓으러 간 거죠? 그 둘이 무슨 원한이라도 있는 건가요...?","source_cn":"为什么他要追泰西欧？他们有仇还是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39F25791FA510EFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1210534004:1":{"text":"요점만 얘기한다면, 있어.","source_cn":"长话短说：有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A096E8BB8607EB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1210534005:1":{"text":"아버지에 대한 원한이.","source_cn":"而且是父仇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x106755AA3CBECA74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1210534006:1":{"text":"네? 그런 얘기는 들어본 적이 없는데...","source_cn":"哎？从没听他提起过……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x768BAC019754174C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1210534007:1":{"text":"말하자면 복잡해. 나중에 직접 물어봐. 우선 놓치지 않게 쫓아가자.","source_cn":"这事比较复杂，你们以后问他吧，我们先追，别跟丢了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0611877208BC64D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:35:12010532:0":{"text":"신밧드가 비밀 통로의 기믹을 열고 먼저 쫓아나갔다.","source_cn":"辛巴达帮你们打开密道的机关门，抢先一步追了出去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB26297F838F44046","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:0:1":{"text":"풀어줘","source_cn":"解开吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0C0516BC46BC1B92","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"풀어줘","female":"풀어줘","variant_male_record_index":"65550","variant_female_record_index":"65551","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1210533017:0":{"text":"이봐, 이봐, 부탁이야. 테시오를 쫓아야 하잖아. 내가 도와줄 수 있다니까!","source_cn":"喂喂，拜托，不是还要追泰西欧吗，我真能帮上忙！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ED88DEACA58208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1210533018:0":{"text":"두 번째 기회는 주지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"我不会再给你第二次机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A074A2A310380CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:19:1:2":{"text":"아니면, 좀 더 묶어놓을까?","source_cn":"要不，再绑一会？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x40809B712CE8C522","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아니면, 좀 더 묶어놓을까?","female":"아니면, 좀 더 묶어놓을까?","variant_male_record_index":"65552","variant_female_record_index":"65553","d